        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">In (FC_ControlMain, from the sequencer's PusherParkCmd): plant pre-start park request - while set, an idle off-home ram reparks to home after the pre-motion warning (REQ-045). With a live cycle request, one of the only two repark occasions (owner ruling 2026-07-16); jog release deliberately leaves the ram where it stopped (REQ-039).</MultiLanguageText>
