      </AttributeList>
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">In (FC_ControlMain, from the sequencer's PusherCycleInhibitCmd): the plant has a live stop reason - no cycle may launch (CycleRequest gated) and an in-flight cycle aborts to Retract and parks (CycleAbort). Hand-jog is deliberately exempt (owner amendment 2026-07-16, REQ-040): only the mode-0 force (stop button/unhealthy) blocks jogging.</MultiLanguageText>
